  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Lang Ya land spirit calls for immortal methods against Feng Jiu Ge, Third Hair answers with an immortal killer move that lays a dark green wooden armor on Heavenly Giant Solor’s body. Feng Jiu Ge’s triple extreme sound lands on that armor and the sound waves are completely absorbed.",
      "chapters": [
        1541
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
        "char_feng_jiu_ge",
        "sys_heavenly_giant_solor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With Sixth Hair, Fourth Hair, Seventh Hair, and the other hairy man Gu Immortals, Third Hair enters Long Hair Ancestor’s refinement path formation under Lang Ya land spirit to refine myriad self Immortal Gu for Fang Yuan. Three days and nights later Third Hair starts tossing Gu worms into the formation, beginning with self reliance Gu. After Fourth Hair and Sixth Hair carve the burned rock into fragments, Third Hair pours drinking blade wine over them, then later takes out numbers of all-out effort Gu while those two rest.",
      "chapters": [
        1570
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "myriad-self-refinement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_sixth_hair",
        "char_fourth_hair",
        "char_seventh_hair",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_long_hair_ancestor",
        "gu_myriad_self_immortal_gu",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_gu_worms",
        "gu_self_reliance_gu",
        "gu_all_out_effort_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Lang Ya land spirit again leads the Long Hair refinement path formation for myriad self Immortal Gu, Third Hair enters after the land spirit, together with Fourth Hair, Sixth Hair, Seventh Hair, and the other Gu Immortals, with Fang Yuan last.",
      "chapters": [
        1756
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
